_:n77df220a0105439f8cae99ae54aaacdbb6 <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#citationNote> "Ještě jsem tady - Jiřina Kynclová page (JIřina Kynclová; born in Mladá Boleslav; married the journalist Karel Kyncl in 1950; lived in the United States in the late 1950s and 1960s, where her husband worked as presenter for Czechoslovak Radio; after return to Czechoslovakia, the Kyncls were persecuted politically; went into emigration at the age of sixty-five; returned to Czechoslovakia; Mrs. Kynclová, now a widow, lives in Prague)" .
