_:n4e73e90c9ab34cf39c935176dd04c7ddb7 <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#citationNote> "(Dr. Laurence Davis, l.davis@ucc.ie ; Dr. Laurence Davis is College Lecturer and Director of the PhD in Government and Politics in the Department of Government and Politics, where he specializes in the areas of political theory and philosophy, political ideologies, and U.S. politics. He has published widely in these fields, with a particular expertise in radical political thought.)" .
