_:n4394044a53244602bd265782a205a4e0b6 <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#citationNote> "authors/David Hanes webpage (David Hanes, engineer for the Cisco Customer Assurance Engineering group at  Research Triangle Park, North Carolina. Technical expert for Cisco in the area of fax over IP technologies. Joined Cisco in 1997, working for WAN, WAN switching, and multiservice voice teams, voice anf fax technologies. Previously worked as a Systems Engineer for Sprint. Has B.S. degree in electrical engineering at North Carolina State University. Author of: SaaS fundamentals; IoT fundamentals)" .
