_:n40bf980b2e504787aa0979e464d3de9eb7 <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#citationNote> "(The Many Worlds of Mickie Dalton: The First Book in the Mickie Dalton Trilogy ... IT executive and consultant ... first novel, a psychological thriller called \"Dreamkill\" was published in the USA in 1996 and more than twenty books have since followed, political, crime and \"spook\" thrillers, sci-fi and a whole series of adventure and sci-fi books for children, completed as collaborative projects with students at High Schools and Junior Schools. He has lived in the UK, Canada, Australia, the USA and worked around the world, much of the time in South East Asia. He is now a full-time writer, teacher and publisher, living ... near the coast of New South Wales north of Sydney.)" .
