_:naaf33edd3c194c5faa9ca5dec3b30bc4b12 <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#occupation> <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2021006989> .
_:naaf33edd3c194c5faa9ca5dec3b30bc4b6 <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#citationNote> "\"Dr Milan Dabović\" webpage (dr Milan Dabović, born October 10, 1960 in Brčko; taught budget and audit at the Law Department of Belgrade University (since 2003) and at other universities; Montenegrin economist and specialist in financial audit. From 1987 to 1992, he worked as an advisor for economic flow planning in the Municipality of Podgorica. From 1992 to 1996, he served as the head of the Center for Fiscal Analysis and Tax Accounting in the Directorate of Public Revenues. From 1996 to 2006, he worked as the Assistant Minister for Budget Planning and Execution in Montenegro at the Ministry of Finance. In 2006, he was appointed as a member of the Senate of the State Audit Institution, responsible for managing public sector audits, and was appointed President of the Senate in August 2013)" .
<http://id.loc.gov/rwo/agents/n2012030926> <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#birthDate> "1960-10-10"^^<http://id.loc.gov/datatypes/edtf> .
